{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-06-21 09:25:00', 'title': 'AEP NAMES JAMES TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO , JUNE 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DONNA A. JAMES, MANAGING DIRECTOR AND FOUNDER OF LARDON & ASSOCIATES, LLC, HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) BOARD OF DIRECTORS.'}